{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider this histogram of the scores for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> students taking a test:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/3738fa09e51884c2e5387d78a541bcc5b8f79acb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(12); draw((0,0)--(26,0)); draw((1,1)--(25,1)); draw((3,2)--(25,2)); draw((5,3)--(23,3)); draw((5,4)--(21,4)); draw((7,5)--(21,5)); draw((9,6)--(21,6)); draw((11,7)--(19,7)); draw((11,8)--(19,8)); draw((11,9)--(19,9)); draw((11,10)--(19,10)); draw((13,11)--(19,11)); draw((13,12)--(19,12)); draw((13,13)--(17,13)); draw((13,14)--(17,14)); draw((15,15)--(17,15)); draw((15,16)--(17,16));  draw((1,0)--(1,1)); draw((3,0)--(3,2)); draw((5,0)--(5,4)); draw((7,0)--(7,5)); draw((9,0)--(9,6)); draw((11,0)--(11,10)); draw((13,0)--(13,14)); draw((15,0)--(15,16)); draw((17,0)--(17,16)); draw((19,0)--(19,12)); draw((21,0)--(21,6)); draw((23,0)--(23,3)); draw((25,0)--(25,2));  for (int a = 1; a &lt; 13; ++a) {     draw((2*a,-.25)--(2*a,.25)); }  label(&quot;$40$&quot;,(2,-.25),S); label(&quot;$45$&quot;,(4,-.25),S); label(&quot;$50$&quot;,(6,-.25),S); label(&quot;$55$&quot;,(8,-.25),S); label(&quot;$60$&quot;,(10,-.25),S); label(&quot;$65$&quot;,(12,-.25),S); label(&quot;$70$&quot;,(14,-.25),S); label(&quot;$75$&quot;,(16,-.25),S); label(&quot;$80$&quot;,(18,-.25),S); label(&quot;$85$&quot;,(20,-.25),S); label(&quot;$90$&quot;,(22,-.25),S); label(&quot;$95$&quot;,(24,-.25),S);  label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(2,1),N); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(4,2),N); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(6,4),N); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(8,5),N); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(10,6),N); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(12,10),N); label(&quot;$14$&quot;,(14,14),N); label(&quot;$16$&quot;,(16,16),N); label(&quot;$12$&quot;,(18,12),N); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(20,6),N); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(22,3),N); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(24,2),N);  label(&quot;Number&quot;,(4,8),N); label(&quot;of Students&quot;,(4,7),N);  label(&quot;$\\textbf{STUDENT TEST SCORES}$&quot;,(14,18),N); [/asy]\" width=\"522\" height=\"412\" />\n</p><p>The median is in the interval labeled \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f03746e91eb1cc665f03290c999ff4b40751d7f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 60 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 65 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 70 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 75 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> students took the test, the median is the score of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a8986c2e423cf3c77c767614254b929b9bde09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41^{st}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> student. The five rightmost intervals include <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cda189f90e782dde56b45449d924d50e4f1dbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+3+6+12+16=39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" /> students, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a8986c2e423cf3c77c767614254b929b9bde09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41^{st}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> one must lie in the next interval, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/2/66209d9ea88e1e7f8d5f1d505e236a03d77f593b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ 70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php